	DisplayStringHead("C0Drake",~你知道，光看着你的就让我羡慕。你下巴上那些细密浓茂的须丝，在风里飘。我几乎想去摸……~)
	SetGlobalTimer("BD_BANTER_DELAY","MYAREA",5)
	SetGlobal("C02DrakeVoghiln1","MYAREA",60)
RESPONSE #60
	DisplayStringHead("Voghiln",~呃……~)
	SetGlobalTimer("BD_BANTER_DELAY","MYAREA",5)
	SetGlobal("C02DrakeVoghiln1","MYAREA",70)
RESPONSE #70
	DisplayStringHead("C0Drake",~*笑* 逗你玩的。~)
	SetGlobalTimer("BD_BANTER_DELAY","MYAREA",5)
	SetGlobal("C02DrakeVoghiln1","MYAREA",-1)
END

IF
	InMyArea(Player1)
	!ActuallyInCombat()
	!GlobalTimerNotExpired("BD_BANTER_DELAY","MYAREA")
	GlobalGT("C02DrakeVoghiln2","MYAREA",0)
	Switch("C02DrakeVoghiln2","MYAREA")
THEN
RESPONSE #1
	DisplayStringHead("Voghiln",~那么，德雷克，你从南边地方来，对吧？也许你能给沃吉尔恩讲讲安姆女人？~)
	SetGlobalTimer("BD_BANTER_DELAY","MYAREA",5)
	SetGlobal("C02DrakeVoghiln2","MYAREA",10)
RESPONSE #10
	DisplayStringHead("C0Drake",~看你对什么有兴趣，我能讲很多。至少城里女人的事。~)
	SetGlobalTimer("BD_BANTER_DELAY","MYAREA",5)
	SetGlobal("C02DrakeVoghiln2","MYAREA",20)
RESPONSE #20
	DisplayStringHead("Voghiln",~对，让我想想……也许你能讲讲你们骑士团里的女人？是叫光辉之心吧？~)
	SetGlobalTimer("BD_BANTER_DELAY","MYAREA",5)
	SetGlobal("C02DrakeVoghiln2","MYAREA",30)
RESPONSE #30
	DisplayStringHead("C0Drake",~嘿，你一开口就把门槛设得挺高，我的朋友。可惜，我不确定你在那儿能有多少运气。我那些女性上级全是名门出身、有爵位有职位的正经淑女。~)
	SetGlobalTimer("BD_BANTER_DELAY","MYAREA",5)
	SetGlobal("C02DrakeVoghiln2","MYAREA",40)
RESPONSE #40
	DisplayStringHead("Voghiln",~也许你说的是实话，我的朋友，可俗话说，没挑战就没乐趣，对吧？~)
	SetGlobalTimer("BD_BANTER_DELAY","MYAREA",5)
	SetGlobal("C02DrakeVoghiln2","MYAREA",50)
RESPONSE #50
	DisplayStringHead("C0Drake",~嘿。别的不说，我倒很想看你出丑。哪天来阿斯卡特拉自己看看。我们可以在我最爱的几家酒馆一起喝一杯。~)
	SetGlobalTimer("BD_BANTER_DELAY","MYAREA",5)
	SetGlobal("C02DrakeVoghiln2","MYAREA",-1)
END

